# Admin Panel System (Canonical Reference)

Use for all **Admin Panel** work (`/admin/*`). Admin UI mirrors the Warehouse Panel design language but uses the **`adm-*`** prefix and `AdminPanel.css`.

**Customer/storefront** → `.cursor/rules/home-design-system.mdc`  
**Warehouse panel** → `.cursor/rules/dashboard-panel-design-system.mdc` (`wm-*`)  
**Admin panel** → this rule (`adm-*`)

