| Layer | Path |
|-------|------|
| Layout shell | `front_end/src/layouts/AdminLayout.js`, `styles/layouts/AdminLayout.css` |
| Sidebar | `front_end/src/layouts/Sidebar.js`, `styles/layouts/Sidebar.css` |
| Sidebar icons | `front_end/src/components/SidebarMenuIcon.js` |
