| Page header | `front_end/src/components/PageHeader.js`, `styles/shared/PageDesign.css` |
| Global modal overlay | `styles/shared/AdminPageDesign.css` (via `App.css`) |
| Tokens | `styles/App.css` |
| Routes | `front_end/src/App.js` |
| API config | `front_end/src/config/api.js` |
| HTTP client | `front_end/src/services/http.js` |
| i18n helpers | `i18n/uiText.js` → `tUi()`, `i18n/roles.js` → `getRoleLabel()` |
