## Architecture

### Layout DOM
```
.admin-layout
  Navbar                    ← panel mode when isRestrictedArea
  .admin-container
    aside.sidebar             ← fixed 250px; Feather icons via SidebarMenuIcon
    main.admin-content        ← <Outlet />; margin-inline-start: 250px
```

- Sidebar fixed **250px**; content uses **logical** offset for LTR + RTL.
- **≤1024px:** sidebar → horizontal scroll nav; content full width.
- **≤768px:** reduced content padding (`1rem`).

### Navbar panel mode (`Navbar.js`)
When `isRestrictedArea` (admin, warehouse, support, driver, cashier, seller, etc.):
- Class `navbar--panel` on `<nav>` (behavior is mostly **conditional rendering**, not CSS offset).
- **Hide:** search, cart, wishlist, storefront links.
- **Show:** role dashboard link, profile avatar dropdown, language icon (`LanguageSwitcher icon`), theme toggle.
- Logo links to role dashboard via `getDashboardHomePath()`.
- Profile routes are panel-scoped: `/admin/profile`, `/support/profile`, `/warehouse/profile`, etc.
- Profile dropdown: **click to toggle** (no hover-open); menu must not be clipped (`overflow: visible` on desktop `.navbar-menu`).
- Navbar container: full-width grid — logo left | search center (storefront only) | menu right.

### Routing & roles

| Path | Guard | Layout / pages |
|------|-------|----------------|
| `/admin/*` | `requireAdmin` | `AdminLayout` + `pages/admin/*` |
| `/support/*` | support manager | `AdminLayout` + `pages/support-manager/*` |
| `/warehouse/*` | warehouse manager | `AdminLayout` + `pages/warehouse-manager/*` (`wm-*`) |
| `/seller/*` | seller | Reuses `AdminCategories`, `AdminPromotions` |

**Operations manager:** sidebar = orders, installments, deliveries only; dashboard hides catalog stats/actions; navbar label `navbar.operationsManager`; home `/admin/orders`.

**Sidebar menus:** `ADMIN_MENU_ITEMS`, `OPERATIONS_MANAGER_MENU_ITEMS`, etc. in `Sidebar.js`. Icon keys map to `SidebarMenuIcon.js` (Feather `react-icons/fi`, tinted icon boxes). Panel brand icons: admin=`FiLayout`, operations=`FiActivity`, support=`FiHeadphones`, warehouse=`FiBox`. Drag-reorder persisted: `localStorage` key `admin-sidebar-order:{userId}`.

### Backend role dependencies

| Helper (`admin.py`) | Roles |
|--------|-------|
| `require_admin` | admin |
| `require_admin_or_operations_manager` | admin, operations_manager |
| `require_admin_or_support_manager` | admin, support_manager |
| `require_admin_or_warehouse_manager` | admin, warehouse_manager |
| `require_seller_or_admin` | admin, seller, warehouse_manager |

**User rules (`users.py`):** admin cannot change own role; admin cannot delete self. Mirror in UI: hide Change Role / Block on own account in `AdminUserDetails.js` (`isSelf` check).

Settings: `admin_settings.py` — low-stock threshold, warehouse address.

## Page shell & naming

### Required structure (new admin pages)
```jsx
<div className="admin-page-shell adm-page adm-{feature}-page">
  <PageHeader kicker title subtitle actions />
  <section className="adm-{short}-section">
    <div className="adm-{short}-section-header"><h2>…</h2></div>
    {/* toolbar | data-panel | list | empty */}
  </section>
</div>
```

### CSS imports (modern pages)
```js
import '../../styles/pages/admin/AdminPanel.css';  // always
import '../../styles/pages/admin/Admin{Page}.css'; // page-scoped adm-{short}-*
```

### Prefix rules

| Prefix | Use |
|--------|-----|
| `admin-page-shell` | Required wrapper on every panel page |
| `adm-page` | Flex column shell, gap, max-width |
| `adm-*` | Shared primitives in `AdminPanel.css` |
| `adm-{short}-*` | Page-scoped — **never** bare `.card`, `.stat-card` |
| `admin-*` | **Legacy** — avoid for new work |

### Page inventory

| Page | Route | Shell class | CSS prefix |
|------|-------|-------------|------------|
| Dashboard | `/admin` | `adm-dashboard` | `adm-stat-*`, `adm-action-*` |
| Products | `/admin/products` | `adm-products-page` | `adm-products-*` |
| Categories | `/admin/categories` | `adm-categories-page` | `adm-cat-*` |
| Discounts | `/admin/discounts` | `adm-discounts-page` | `adm-discount-*` |
| Promotions | `/admin/promotions` | `adm-promotions-page` | `adm-promo-*` |
| Orders | `/admin/orders` | `adm-orders-page` | `adm-orders-*` |
| Installments | `/admin/installments` | `adm-inst-page` | `adm-inst-*` |
| Deliveries | `/admin/deliveries` | `adm-del-page` | `adm-del-*` |
| Users | `/admin/users` | `adm-users-page` | `adm-users-*` |
| User details | `/admin/users/:id` | `adm-udetail-page` | `adm-udetail-*` |
| Tickets | `/admin/tickets` | `adm-tkt-page` | `adm-tkt-*` |
| Reviews | `/admin/comments` | `adm-reviews-page` | `adm-reviews-*` |
| Feedback | `/admin/feedback` | `admin-feedback` | `adm-fb-*` |
| Profile | `/admin/profile` | `profile-page` (shared `Profile.js`) | `Profile.css` |

**Legacy (do not copy):** `AdminPosAnalytics.js` — old `stats-grid`, no `AdminPanel.css`, hardcoded strings.

**Partial legacy shells:** `AdminComments.js`, `AdminFeedback.js` — omit `adm-page` / `AdminPanel.css`; use page-local shell. Prefer migrating to canonical shell when editing.

## UI patterns — reuse before inventing

| Pattern | Reference |
|---------|-----------|
| Dashboard stats + quick actions | `AdminDashboard.js` |
| PageHeader + header filters | `AdminOrders.js`, `AdminUsers.js` |
| Toolbar + search + pill filters | `AdminProducts.js`, `AdminCategories.js` |
| Data table in rounded panel | `AdminOrders.js` (`.adm-orders-data-panel`) |
| Master–detail | `AdminComments.js`, `AdminFeedback.js` |
| Expandable list cards | `AdminTickets.js`, `AdminDeliveries.js` |
| Inline create/edit + list | `AdminPromotions.js`, `AdminDiscounts.js` |
| User list → detail actions | `AdminUsers.js` (list) + `AdminUserDetails.js` (actions) |
| CRUD modal | `AdminProducts.js`, `AdminDashboard.js` (threshold) |
| Confirm before delete | `useConfirm` in Products, Categories, Users |

### Manage Users conventions
- **List (`AdminUsers.js`):** columns = user, email, role, created — **no Actions column**; row click → `/admin/users/:id`.
- **Details (`AdminUserDetails.js`):** hero row = avatar + name + badges | action buttons (Change Role primary, Block, Delete). Hide Change Role + Block when `isSelf`. PageHeader subtitle = generic only (no name/email/id line).
- **Role labels:** always `getRoleLabel()` from `i18n/roles.js` — keys `roles.{role}` in en/ar/fr.
- **Avatars:** `resolveProfileImageUrl()` from `utils/helpers.js` + `referrerPolicy="no-referrer"`.

### PageHeader
```jsx
<PageHeader
  kicker={t('ui.sidebar.panel.admin')}
  title={tUi('ui.pages.admin.adminOrders.title_...')}
  subtitle={tUi('ui.pages.admin.adminOrders.subtitle_...')}
  actions={<motion.button className="adm-btn-primary">…</motion.button>}
/>
```

### Loading / empty
```jsx
<div className="page-loading adm-page-loading"><LoadingSpinner size="large" /></div>
<div className="adm-{page}-empty"><p>{tUi('...')}</p></div>
```

### Header CTA buttons (match Add Product)
- `adm-btn-primary` / `adm-btn-secondary`
- Create actions: `motion.button` + `FaPlus`
- Sizing locked in `AdminPanel.css` under `.adm-page .page-header-actions` (`1rem` font, `0.65rem 1.5rem` padding, `min-height: 44px`)
- Do **not** override with page-specific create-btn classes

### Modals
- Overlay: `.admin-modal-overlay` → card: `.admin-modal`
- Fields: `.adm-modal-field`, `.adm-modal-hint`, `.adm-modal-actions`
- Product modal: `AdminProductsModal.css` (`.adm-product-modal`)

## Styling language

Typography, colors, cards, motion — same as dashboard rule (Space Grotesk + Fraunces, CSS variables, `1.2rem` radius, `0.3s ease` hovers). See `.cursor/rules/dashboard-panel-design-system.mdc` for tokens.

### Admin-specific layout
- Default max-width: **1200px** (`.adm-page`)
- Catalog pages: **1400px** → **1600px** at `≥1600px`
- Dashboard gap: **2rem**; other pages: **4rem** (`2.5rem` mobile)
- Stats: `repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr))`
- Actions: `repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr))` — 1 col ≤768px
- List grids: `minmax(300–340px, 1fr)` at `≥1280px` / `≥1600px`

### Buttons
- **Primary:** `.adm-btn-primary` — pill, primary fill, hover lift
- **Secondary:** `.adm-btn-secondary` — pill, bordered surface
- Row/card actions: smaller scoped overrides under `.adm-*-card-actions`, not page headers

### Responsive breakpoints

| Breakpoint | Where | Behavior |
|------------|-------|----------|
| **≥1600px** | `AdminPanel.css`, catalog pages | max-width 1600px; wider grids |
| **≥1280px** | `AdminPanel.css`, products/categories | wider stat/action/list grids |
| **≤1100px** | orders, users, tickets, deliveries | toolbar/table stacking |
| **≤1024px** | `AdminLayout.css`, `Sidebar.css` | sidebar horizontal; content full width |
| **≤900px** | deliveries | two-column detail reflow |
| **≤768px** | `AdminPanel.css`, most pages | gap 2.5rem; single-column grids; stacked toolbars |
| **≤560px** | products | extra compact |
| **≤480px** | comments, navbar | mobile tweaks |

### RTL & dark mode
- Logical properties: `margin-inline-start`, `inset-inline-*`, `text-align: start`
- Mirror arrows: `html[dir='rtl'] .adm-action-card-arrow { transform: scaleX(-1); }`
- Toast RTL position in `App.js`
- Dark: override per page under `.dark`; never `var(--text-primary)` on light overlay pills

### CSS file layout
```
styles/pages/admin/
  AdminPanel.css          ← shared adm-* primitives
  Admin{Page}.css         ← page-scoped adm-{short}-*
  AdminProductsPage.css   ← products shell only
  AdminProductsModal.css  ← product modal only
  AdminPromotionsPage.css ← promotions shell only
```

**Products note:** `AdminProducts.css` uses `font: inherit` on buttons **except** `.adm-btn-primary`/`.adm-btn-secondary`.

